#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md:2307
msgid "Common Issues and Solutions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Issue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Abstract too generic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Delete first sentence if it could prepend any ML paper. Start with your "
"specific contribution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Introduction exceeds 1.5 pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Split background into Related Work. Front-load contribution bullets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Experiments lack explicit claims"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Add: \"This experiment tests whether [specific claim]...\" before each "
"one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Reviewers find paper hard to follow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Add signposting, use consistent terminology, make figure captions self-"
"contained."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Missing statistical significance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Add error bars, number of runs, statistical tests, confidence intervals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Scope creep in experiments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Every experiment must map to a specific claim. Cut experiments that don't."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Paper rejected, need to resubmit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"See Conference Resubmission in Phase 7. Address reviewer concerns without"
" referencing reviews."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Missing broader impact statement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"See Step 5.10. Most venues require it. \"No negative impacts\" is almost "
"never credible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Human eval criticized as weak"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"See Step 2.5 and [references/human-evaluation.md](references/human-"
"evaluation.md). Report agreement metrics, annotator details, "
"compensation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Reviewers question reproducibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Release code (Step 7.9), document all hyperparameters, include seeds and "
"compute details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Theory paper lacks intuition"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Add proof sketches with plain-language explanations before formal proofs."
" See [references/paper-types.md](references/paper-types.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid "Results are negative/null"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/research-paper-writing_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"See Phase 4.3 on handling negative results. Consider workshops, TMLR, or "
"reframing as analysis."
msgstr ""

